{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T22:13:15.614Z","data":{"text":"Task 3 complete.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **New `src/core/status/dependency-readiness.ts`**: moved `isDependencyDone`, its `findFolder` helper, and the shared `listDir` out of `state.ts`. An archived dependency now counts as met only when `readVerification` reports no requirement or a `passed` outcome; rejected/unfinished active ones stay unmet. Also exports `isVerificationPending`.\n- **`src/core/status/state.ts`**: imports those helpers back; `resolveUnmetDependencies` and all exports unchanged.\n- **`src/core/status/queue-state.ts`**: `QueueItemState` gains `verification-pending`; `selectAssociation` derives a single archived association as pending while verification has not passed, keeping it out of `readQueueState`'s landed set.\n- **`src/core/status/queue-report-detail.ts`**: a `verification-pending` row is treated like `landed` when reading the archived association.\n- **New `tests/verification-dependents.test.ts`**: 4 tests covering blocked derivation, `readNextStep` blocked, freeing on `passed`, `failed` staying blocked, no-`verification` staying met, and the queue scenario (`projectQueue`, `prepareQueuePlan`, `formatQueue` `[verification-pending]`).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/verification-dependents.test.ts` — 4/4 pass.\n- `pnpm verify` — exit 0 (typechecks, build, 1760 tests, lint).\n\nBoth `state.ts` (227) and `queue-state.ts` (249 real lines) stay within the source line budget. Result written to `.run/results/3.md`."}}
